      },
      "fixed": true,
      "preconditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "inbox"
        }
      ],
      "from": "mills",
      "playerVisibleAs": "The forklift question is coming; the host nation has been grumbling about theirs. We have a BPA with Harbor Equipment for that, but a BPA is an agreement to take calls, not a promise to fill them. When you call off one, know who you'd go to if they say no. And get the shop into Col Ward's staff meeting: requests come up there days before they reach your desk, and getting in takes a couple of hours."
    },
