          "kind": "inbox"
        }
      ],
      "from": "mills",
      "playerVisibleAs": "I fly out today. Last thing: the honey trucks are the host nation's, and when a service like that comes to you it needs a written contract and a COR watching it, not a run of cash buys because they're faster. You'll be fine."
